---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Tentang Kami — i-Travel | 10 Tahun Perjalanan Menyediakan Rekam Jejak Terpercaya" activeNav="tentang">

  <!-- SECTION 1: STORYTELLING HERO -->
  <section class="relative bg-slate-950 text-white py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_bottom_left,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-rose-950/40 via-slate-950 to-slate-900"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6">
        <span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-300 border border-rose-500/30 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
          Di Balik Layar i-Travel
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white leading-tight">
          Satu Dekade Berdedikasi Menyajikan Fakta, Bukan Angan-Angan.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Sejak melangkah di industri agen perjalanan pada dekade lalu, filosofi kerja kami tidak pernah berubah: rekam jejak nyata adalah bentuk penghormatan tertinggi kepada setiap pelanggan. Setiap senyuman traveler adalah konfirmasi atas komitmen kami.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 2: INTRODUCTORY NARRATIVE SPLIT -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
        
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative">
          <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-slate-200">
            <img 
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1469854523086-cc02fe5d8800?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" 
              alt="Perjalanan petualangan i-Travel menyusuri keindahan alam" 
              class="w-full h-[450px] object-cover"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 bg-sky-500 text-white p-6 rounded-3xl shadow-xl max-w-xs hidden sm:block">
            <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold block">10+ Tahun</span>
            <span class="text-xs font-medium text-sky-100">Ketangguhan Operasional & Kepercayaan Pelanggan</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-sky-600 uppercase tracking-widest">Komitmen Utama Kami</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-tight">
            Mengapa Ratusan Perusahaan Mempercayakan Perjalanannya Kepada Kami?
          </h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-600 text-base leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Di i-Travel, kami memandang <strong>setiap klien sebagai mitra berharga</strong> yang tidak boleh dikecewakan oleh janji manis di atas kertas. Rekam jejak layanan kami selama <strong>10 tahun berdiri</strong> membuktikan bahwa transparansi dan kepastian eksekusi adalah pondasi utama bisnis ini.
            </p>
            <p>
              Hingga saat ini, lebih dari <strong>450+ klien corporat maupun personal</strong> telah mempercayakan perjalanan gathering, incentive tour, hingga liburan khusus mereka kepada tim spesialis kami.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">Prinsip Kepuasan</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Kebahagiaan dan ketenangan pikiran klien di atas segala target operasional.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">Keamanan Total</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Armada, asuransi, dan panduan darurat tersertifikasi di tiap destinasi.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 3: VERTICAL TIMELINE (UNIQUE STRUCTURAL ELEMENT) -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-slate-50 relative">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-3">
        <span class="px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-100 text-rose-700 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          Jejak Langkah Perusahaan
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">10 Tahun Mengukir Pengalaman Terbaik</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Bagaimana i-Travel tumbuh dari penyedia tour lokal menjadi agen travel internasional terpercaya.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Timeline Structure -->
      <div class="relative border-l-2 border-slate-300 ml-4 md:ml-32 space-y-12">
        
        <!-- Timeline Item 1 -->
        <div class="relative pl-8 md:pl-12 group">
          <!-- Circle Marker -->
          <div class="absolute -left-[17px] top-1.5 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-sky-500 border-4 border-white shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold">
            ✓
          </div>
          <!-- Date Badge (Desktop Left) -->
          <div class="md:absolute md:-left-32 md:top-1.5 text-sky-600 font-extrabold text-lg mb-2 md:mb-0">
            2016
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm group-hover:border-sky-300 transition-colors">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Awal Berdiri & Layanan Rute Domestik</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Memulai perjalanan dengan fokus pada layanan gathering privat di Jawa & Bali, meletakkan standar service unggulan untuk kepuasan pelanggan pertama.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Timeline Item 2 -->
        <div class="relative pl-8 md:pl-12 group">
          <div class="absolute -left-[17px] top-1.5 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-rose-500 border-4 border-white shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold">
            ✓
          </div>
          <div class="md:absolute md:-left-32 md:top-1.5 text-rose-500 font-extrabold text-lg mb-2 md:mb-0">
            2019
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm group-hover:border-rose-300 transition-colors">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Ekspansi Divisi Corporate Outing</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Resmi menangani rombongan korporat besar hingga 500 peserta dalam satu rangkaian trip dengan nol komplain eksekusi.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Timeline Item 3 -->
        <div class="relative pl-8 md:pl-12 group">
          <div class="absolute -left-[17px] top-1.5 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 border-4 border-white shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold">
            ✓
          </div>
          <div class="md:absolute md:-left-32 md:top-1.5 text-emerald-600 font-extrabold text-lg mb-2 md:mb-0">
            2022
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm group-hover:border-emerald-300 transition-colors">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Pembukaan Rute Asia & Eropa VIP</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Melengkapi sertifikasi internasional dan menjalin kemitraan dengan maskapai penerbangan dunia serta penginapan bintang 5.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Timeline Item 4 -->
        <div class="relative pl-8 md:pl-12 group">
          <div class="absolute -left-[17px] top-1.5 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border-4 border-white shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold">
            ★
          </div>
          <div class="md:absolute md:-left-32 md:top-1.5 text-slate-900 font-extrabold text-lg mb-2 md:mb-0">
            Sekarang
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-50 to-rose-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-sky-200 shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Pencapaian 450+ Klien Puas</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Terus bertransformasi menghadirkan teknologi booking seamless dan pendampingan 24 jam untuk menjamin kenyamanan tak tertandingi.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 4: TEAM LEADERSHIP SPOTLIGHT -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-sky-600 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Tim Profesional Kami</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Manusia di Balik Keunggulan Layanan</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        
        <!-- Team Member 1 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 text-center p-6 space-y-4">
          <div class="w-32 h-32 mx-auto rounded-full overflow-hidden border-4 border-white shadow-lg">
            <img 
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560250097-0b93528c311a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80" 
              alt="Potret Managing Director i-Travel" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Bpk. Hendra Wijaya</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-sky-600 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mt-0.5">Managing Director</p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            15+ tahun di industri penerbangan dan pariwisata. Menjamin setiap kontrak tur dipenuhi tanpa ada kompromi standar.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Team Member 2 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 text-center p-6 space-y-4">
          <div class="w-32 h-32 mx-auto rounded-full overflow-hidden border-4 border-white shadow-lg">
            <img 
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80" 
              alt="Potret Head of Corporate Operations i-Travel" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Ibu Maya Saraswati</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-sky-600 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mt-0.5">Head of Corporate Operations</p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Pakar perencana logistik rombongan skala besar. Memastikan seluruh kebutuhan khusus klien corporat terpenuhi sempurna.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Team Member 3 -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 text-center p-6 space-y-4">
          <div class="w-32 h-32 mx-auto rounded-full overflow-hidden border-4 border-white shadow-lg">
            <img 
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80" 
              alt="Potret Chief Tour Leader i-Travel" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Rian Ardiansyah</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-sky-600 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mt-0.5">Chief Tour Leader</p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Energik, ramah, dan menguasai rute-rute populer Asia & Eropa. Menghidupkan suasana perjalanan agar senantiasa ceria.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <div class="client-data-tag">
          ⚠️ [PERLU DATA CLIENT: Foto & Struktur Manajemen Lengkap i-Travel]
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 5: CTA CONTEXTUAL -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-slate-900 text-white text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">Ingin Diskusi Langsung Mengenai Rencana Wisata Anda?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Tim kami siap memberikan konsultasi gratis dan rancangan estimasi biaya transparan tanpa komitmen awal.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <a href="/kontak" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500 hover:bg-rose-600 text-white font-bold transition-colors">
          <span>Hubungi Tim Konsultan i-Travel</span>
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
